  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:36px\">TFC More Items&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">补充以下物品的增强模组</span></strong></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>- <span style=\"color:#f60\">厚重金属板 (Heavy Sheets)</span></strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>- <span style=\"color:#f60\">金属箔 (Foil)</span></strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>- <span style=\"color:#f60\">齿轮 (Gears)</span></strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>- <span style=\"color:#f60\">雄蕊 (Stamens)</span></strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>- <span style=\"color:#f60\">螺丝、钉子、铆钉 (Screws, Nails, Rivets)</span></strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>- <span style=\"color:#f60\">环 (Rings)</span></strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>- <span style=\"color:#f60\">线材 (Wires)<br><span style=\"color:#000\">- </span>皮革部件：线、带子、条状皮<br><span style=\"color:#000\">-</span>植物纤维绳、布料、方块、竹纤维、竹绳<br><span style=\"color:#000\">- </span>弓部件：弓臂、弦、箭尾槽、箭羽、箭杆&nbsp;<br></span></strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>本模组最初为 HardRock 整合包开发，旨在补充合成配方并拓展创造模式的可能性。</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>物品拥有独立的 TFC 铁砧合成及熔炼配方，同时也兼容原版 Minecraft。</strong></span><br><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">&nbsp;== <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">如果您使用原版环境，则需要自行添加合成配方</span> ==<br><br><span style=\"color:#843fa1;font-size:18px\">\"TFC IE Addon\" 与 \"Firmalife\" 的金属兼容性</span></span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1082/219/splitimg.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1980\" height=\"1080\"></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">如果您需要特定的新物品，请联系我们，我们可以为您制作并将其包含在包中以满足您的偏好。</span><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">---------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br>尝试其他适用于 TFC 的 1.20.1 和 1.21.1 模组<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-debark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/241/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"Debark TFC\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><strong style=\"font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-lumberjack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/251/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/corals-tfc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/249/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-ore-washing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/250/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight-tfc/gallery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/247/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spindles-tfc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/253/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-better-stone-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1361/261/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-metal-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1361/263/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-muskets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1361/262/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><br>...</span></span><br></strong></p>",
